DESCRIPTION:In this course\, we will explore mid-century design as students
  build their own lounge chair. Upgrade is also available to build a matchi
 ng Mid-Century Modern Ottoman during class for an additional $200. You wil
 l build the ottoman simultaneously while building your chair.
SUMMARY:Mid Century Modern Chair
URL;VALUE=URI:https://ce.sbwi.edu/s/courseoffering/0P0Hu000000TbwIKAS
END:VEVENT
